offensive.text:
**Requirements** The pipefox saw a cantrip cast within the last minute;

---

**Effect** The pipefox can cast the cantrip it saw as an innate arcane spell for 1 minute.

**Frequency** three times per day;

---

**Effect** The river drake Strides or Flies twice.

**Frequency** once per round;

---

**Effect** The scout takes a [Stride](/action/stride-player-core) action and a [Swim](/action/swim-player-core) action, in either order. They ignore difficult terrain from mud, quicksand, and similar terrain during this movement.

**Frequency** once per 10 minutes;

---

**Effect** The tengu waves their feather fan, summoning a small magical breeze that kicks up dust in a area centered on a corner of their space, which lasts for 1d4 rounds. All creatures within that area are Concealed, and all other creatures are concealed to them.

**Trigger** The warsworn moves into a dying creature's space;

---

**Effect** The warsworn absorbs the [dying](/condition/dying-player-core) creature into itself, instantly killing the creature and healing the warsworn for a number of Hit Points equal to the creature's level. As long as the warsworn still exists, absorbed creatures can't be resurrected except by Wish or a similarly powerful effect.

